---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { nav, siteTitle } from '../layouts';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f5f1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Employer Branding Manager take-home assignment for Prima Assicurazioni." />
    <title>{siteTitle}</title>
    <style>
      .overview-page .nav { gap:10px; }
      .overview-page .nav a { padding:10px 14px; font-size:1rem; font-weight:850; }
      .overview-page .overview-kicker { font-size:.9rem; letter-spacing:.1em; }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-label { font-size:.84rem; letter-spacing:.13em; }
      .overview-page .overview-task-label { font-size:.96rem; line-height:1.1; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:var(--prima-navy); }
      .overview-page .grid.two > .card-prima { background:#fff; border-color:var(--line); }
      .overview-page .grid.two > .card-violet { background:var(--prima-soft); border-color:#dac6ee; }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-grid { margin-top:20px; gap:20px; }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-item { min-height:158px; padding:22px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-start; gap:42px; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(33,40,58,.08); }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-item:nth-child(1),
      .overview-page .overview-thread-item:nth-child(2),
      .overview-page .overview-thread-item:nth-child(3) { background:#fff; border-color:var(--line); }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-index { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:6px; line-height:1; }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-num { font-size:.78rem; font-weight:950; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--prima); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-slash { font-size:.82rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-name { font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-.025em; color:var(--prima-navy); }
      .overview-page .overview-thread-question { margin:0; font-size:1.02rem; line-height:1.2; font-weight:850; letter-spacing:-.02em; max-width:28ch; }
      .overview-page .overview-benchmark-note { margin-top:24px; padding:26px 24px 22px; border-top:0; border:1px solid #384155; border-radius:20px; background:var(--prima-navy); color:#fff; }
      .overview-page .overview-benchmark-quote { margin:0; font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2rem); line-height:1.08; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-.035em; max-width:34ch; color:#fff; }
      .overview-page .overview-benchmark-caption { display:block; margin-top:14px; color:#c7cbd5; font-size:.88rem; font-weight:750; }
      @media (max-width:759px) {
        .overview-page .nav a { padding:9px 12px; font-size:.92rem; }
        .overview-page .overview-kicker { font-size:.84rem; }
        .overview-page .overview-task-label { font-size:.9rem; }
        .overview-page .overview-thread-item { min-height:150px; padding:20px; gap:34px; }
        .overview-page .overview-thread-name { font-size:1rem; }
        .overview-page .overview-benchmark-note { padding:22px 20px 20px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="overview-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="shell header-inner">
        <a class="wordmark" href="/prima-employer-brand-takehome/">PRIMA</a>
        <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
          {nav.map((item) => <a href={`/prima-employer-brand-takehome${item.href}`} aria-current={item.href === '/' ? 'page' : undefined}>{item.label}</a>)}
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="shell hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <span class="kicker overview-kicker">Employer Branding Manager</span>
            <h1>Take-home Assignment</h1>
            <p class="lead">A candidate-first diagnosis of Prima's talent experience, followed by one focused redesign.</p>
          </div>
          <aside class="surface card card-dark sticky-note">
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#aaa">My starting point</div>
            <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.1;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.035em;">Prima already has the proof. The opportunity is to make it work harder when candidates are deciding.</p>
            <p class="small" style="color:#bdbdbd;margin-top:16px;">I focused on three friction points rather than trying to cover the entire Employer Brand.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">The structure</div>
              <h2>Two exercises. One point of view.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>The submission follows the brief closely: diagnose what is not working, prioritise, then show what “better” could look like.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid two">
            <a class="surface card card-prima" style="text-decoration:none" href="/prima-employer-brand-takehome/task-1/">
              <div class="overview-task-label">01 / Diagnose</div>
              <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Where the talent experience could work harder.</h3>
              <p class="small" style="margin-top:12px">Three problems, why they matter, what I would change first, and one benchmark.</p>
              <p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-weight:900">Open Task 1 →</p>
            </a>
            <a class="surface card card-violet" style="text-decoration:none" href="/prima-employer-brand-takehome/task-2/">
              <div class="overview-task-label">02 / Make something better</div>
              <h3 style="margin-top:12px">From job description to candidate decision tool.</h3>
              <p class="small" style="margin-top:12px">A desktop redesign of a real Prima Software Engineering vacancy, with a deliberate mobile adaptation.</p>
              <p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-weight:900">Open Task 2 →</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="surface card">
            <div class="eyebrow overview-thread-label">The thread</div>
            <div class="grid three overview-thread-grid">
              <article class="overview-thread-item">
                <div class="overview-thread-index"><span class="overview-thread-num">01</span><span class="overview-thread-slash">/</span><span class="overview-thread-name">Role</span></div>
                <p class="overview-thread-question">Would I want to do this specific job at Prima?</p>
              </article>
              <article class="overview-thread-item">
                <div class="overview-thread-index"><span class="overview-thread-num">02</span><span class="overview-thread-slash">/</span><span class="overview-thread-name">Career</span></div>
                <p class="overview-thread-question">Could I see where this role could take me?</p>
              </article>
              <article class="overview-thread-item">
                <div class="overview-thread-index"><span class="overview-thread-num">03</span><span class="overview-thread-slash">/</span><span class="overview-thread-name">Experience</span></div>
                <p class="overview-thread-question">Does the hiring experience match the promise?</p>
              </article>
            </div>
            <div class="overview-benchmark-note">
              <p class="overview-benchmark-quote">“Make the right proof tangible at the right candidate decision moment.”</p>
              <span class="overview-benchmark-caption">The principle I take from the benchmark.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="eyebrow">Prima Assicurazioni</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
